      "details": "Extract the SerializationFormat type and the implementation of ScanResult.fromJSON(String), ScanResult.toJSON(int), and ScanResult.toJSON() into the new same-package ScanResultSerialization class. Preserve the existing public ScanResult methods as wrappers, preserve the current deserialization reconstruction and serialization ordering behavior, and retain the existing ScanResult fully qualified name. The extracted implementation must retain access to the existing ScanResult state required by these methods without adding new public API. After extraction, ScanResult will no longer directly reference JSONDeserializer, JSONSerializer, AutoCloseableExecutorService, or ClassGraph for serialization/deserialization; it will gain only the new direct dependency ScanResultSerialization. The expected net Fan-Out reduction is therefore approximately three distinct dependencies.",
